WEBVTT

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:02.470
Layra...

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Shooter of iron hammers, reside in 
my eye and offer me your power!

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:10.220
Fusion Summon!

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:18.520
Burned image of shooter of iron hammers,

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:21.930
synchronize with my eye, 
and offer me your power!

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:23.940
Synchro Summon!

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:30.510
Ruler of the majestic land,

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:34.060
reside in my eye and offer me your power!

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:35.850
Xyz Summon!

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:50.060
Not long ago, Layra was so frightened...

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:53.620
I won't let you have Yuzu Hiiragi or Serena.

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:55.170
Naturally, not Academia, either.

00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.800
Reiji Akaba...

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:03.920
No matter where he's hidden Serena and 
Yuzu Hiiragi, I shall recover them.

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:08.650
And then, Sergey will kill both 
him and the Council...

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:10.620
To achieve that,

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:16.390
it is necessary to make the people 
focus on the Friendship Cup.

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:21.950
Everyone in the Duel Palace, 
as well as all over City!

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:24.630
I have a big surprise to announce!

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:28.760
We just received word from 
the tournament organizers,

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:34.190
that they've decided to hold the 
first match of the semifinals

00:01:34.190 --> 00:01:37.240
right here, this evening!

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:39.180
We can't go back yet!

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:43.320
We know this will be a battle 
for the history books.

00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:47.610
The first match of the semifinals, 
here at the Friendship Cup, is...

00:01:47.610 --> 00:01:52.070
Yuya Sakaki versus Crow Hogan!

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:56.550
D-Wheels.

00:01:57.240 --> 00:02:00.830
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:02.480
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:05.920
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:08.090
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:47.010
The Memories of the Beast

00:03:47.010 --> 00:04:05.390
Yuya! Yuya! Yuya!

00:03:50.320 --> 00:04:05.390
Crow! Crow! Crow!

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:13.290
Yuya should be somewhere in here.

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:16.480
The first match of the semifinals is

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:18.400
Yuya versus Crow!

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:21.970
Security caught Yuya, but now he's dueling?

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:23.340
What's going on here?

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:34.560
Normally, I would have wanted 
to rework Yuya Sakaki's brain,

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:38.690
but Reiji Akaba's resistance has 
thrown my plans off-course.

00:04:39.190 --> 00:04:43.560
But Yuya must still win this duel.

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:47.030
And gloriously, boldly...

00:04:47.670 --> 00:04:51.930
With a performance from which City's 
people cannot take their eyes,

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:55.220
he must wage a bloody battle with Crow.

00:04:56.280 --> 00:04:57.720
Because while he does,

00:04:57.720 --> 00:05:01.580
Sergey will destroy Reiji Akaba and 
the Administrative Council,

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:05.910
and seize Yuzu Hiiragi and Serena.

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:10.290
For this purpose, I have prepared...

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:17.770
In order to take control of this world,

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:20.570
Roget's taken control of Reiji and 
the Administrative Council.

00:05:21.240 --> 00:05:24.670
And he's after Yuzu and Serena, too.

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:27.520
Right now, I'm the only one free to act!

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:31.340
Good... Now, all the pieces are in place.

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:34.810
Come, give us a show...

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:40.140
As an advance celebration of my becoming 
this dimension's true controller.

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:46.160
Now, Yuya Sakaki and Crow 
Hogan enter the arena!

00:05:58.070 --> 00:06:00.470
Yuya... I'm sorry.

00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:05.950
I thought you Lancers were with the Tops.

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:06.880
But...

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:10.620
When Kurosaki told me that 
he had to beat Academia

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:14.810
to protect the kids back home, 
it opened my eyes.

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:20.830
You're trying to fight an overwhelming 
enemy, just like we are.

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:23.190
There's no way you'd work with the Tops, right?

00:06:23.890 --> 00:06:25.160
Crow...

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:28.310
I also decided to win, for the kids' sake.

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:31.560
No, not just for them...

00:06:31.560 --> 00:06:33.640
For the future of this city.

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:37.610
That's why I can't afford to lose this duel!

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:40.350
Same here.

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:45.050
I made up my mind that I'd make 
everyone smile by winning this duel.

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:50.330
I'd win, beat Jack, and prove to people 
how wonderful duels can be!

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:54.440
But I can't do that anymore now.

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:56.230
You can't? Why not?

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:03.030
Right now, security is holding 
the Administrative Council,

00:07:03.410 --> 00:07:05.590
Reiji, and Layra.

00:07:06.620 --> 00:07:08.210
Your allies?

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:11.690
Roget is trying to take control of City.

00:07:13.180 --> 00:07:17.130
If security's leader takes over City,

00:07:17.130 --> 00:07:19.250
the Commons will be even more...

00:07:19.630 --> 00:07:22.850
That's why we have to stop 
Roget, no matter what.

00:07:23.190 --> 00:07:24.460
That's why, Crow...

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:26.090
I have to ask you a favor.

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:29.780
I don't know what it is, but leave it to me.

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:37.470
Damn, I can't find him anywhere...

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:39.860
Seriously, where'd he go?

00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:53.020
Now, it's time to start the evening duel!

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:58.560
On the city stage, which sparkles 
like a box of jewels at night,

00:07:58.560 --> 00:08:02.100
what kind of battle will we see?

00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:05.930
Something must have happened...

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:09.030
If not, they wouldn't have sent Yuya out.

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:18.590
No matter what's going on, I will save Yuya.

00:08:18.590 --> 00:08:19.820
Wait for me, Yuzu.

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:30.320
Action Field, on.

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:32.790
Field Spell Crossover Acceleration!

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:38.480
Duel mode, on.

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:40.970
Autopilot, stand by.

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:45.400
Riding duel...

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:47.690
Acceleration!

00:08:48.850 --> 00:08:49.870
Duel!

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:53.490
The two Wheels start at the same time.

00:08:53.490 --> 00:08:57.580
Which will be the first out of the 
gate, to take the first turn?

00:08:57.580 --> 00:09:00.290
Yuya or Crow?

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:06.290
The first turn belongs to Crow!

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:09.890
Okay, let's do this! My turn!

00:09:09.890 --> 00:09:13.580
I summon Blackwing — Bora the Spear!

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:19.240
And I set one card and end my turn.

00:09:19.720 --> 00:09:22.500
Roget's trying to take control of City?

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:27.400
Does that have something to do with the 
reason he started the semifinals early?

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.850
If so, then I have no reason to play along!

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:34.230
Roget was originally with Academia.

00:09:34.890 --> 00:09:39.330
I can't imagine anyone who tried to forcefully 
take over the Administrative Council

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:42.330
would run a great society 
after he gained control.

00:09:42.820 --> 00:09:45.160
The future isn't just given to you.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:47.770
It's something we grab, with our own hands.

00:09:48.210 --> 00:09:50.420
That's why I decided, Yuya,

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:52.270
that I would work with you.

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:56.770
We'll have our real match after I seize 
this future, with my own hands!

00:09:56.770 --> 00:09:58.240
Yeah, it's a promise!

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:00.430
Okay! Go, Yuya!

00:10:00.430 --> 00:10:02.740
Make it loud and flashy!

00:10:04.360 --> 00:10:06.820
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:09.530
Here, beneath City's luminous night sky,

00:10:09.530 --> 00:10:13.130
we invite you to watch the equally 
brilliant entertainment

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:15.060
we'll make bloom before your eyes!

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:17.300
My turn!

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:21.270
First, enjoy this dazzling dance performance.

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:25.130
From my hand, I activate my Quick-Play 
Spell Hippo Carnival...

00:10:25.130 --> 00:10:26.750
No, excuse me.

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:30.560
It's the even bigger Super Hippo Carnival!

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:35.860
Its activation lets me Special Summon 
Performapal Hip Hippo!

00:10:37.760 --> 00:10:39.790
When I successfully summon it,

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:44.060
I summon Hippo Tokens to all my Monster Zones!

00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:47.500
Now, come out, hippos.

00:10:51.840 --> 00:10:54.800
And dance... Hippo dancers!

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:00.960
How do you like that?

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:04.710
These are Super Hippo Carnival's hippo dancers!

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:09.680
Enjoy the alluring dance of the 
hippos to your heart's content!

00:11:11.930 --> 00:11:15.120
This is Yuya's magnificent lead-off punch!

00:11:15.370 --> 00:11:20.320
He uses a fun monster dance 
to grab the spectators' hearts!

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:23.700
I won't let Yuya take all the spotlight!

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:27.800
I activate my trap Blackwing — Festival!

00:11:27.800 --> 00:11:32.540
When there's a Blackwing on my side of the field, 
and my opponent Special Summons a monster,

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:37.080
I can Special Summon three 
Blackwing Tokens, as well.

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:41.650
Now, dance with them!

00:11:50.530 --> 00:11:54.060
Hey, wait a minute. The crows 
are dancing with the hippos?

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:56.200
Stop messing with us, you two.

00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:59.900
This is the official semifinals 
of the Friendship Cup.

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:04.250
All of City is watching you. 
Take it more seriously!

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:05.670
We aren't messing with you.

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:07.540
We're dead serious!

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:09.740
Time for you to go, Yuya.

00:12:10.210 --> 00:12:13.030
Thanks, Crow. I'm in your debt.

00:12:15.660 --> 00:12:18.620
That's right. The Administrative 
Council building is right there.

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:23.160
During a duel, a D-Wheel 
on autopilot can't stop,

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:24.860
but you can jump off it.

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:26.090
Jump!

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:27.590
Go, Yuya!

00:12:27.590 --> 00:12:29.580
To your allies...

00:12:30.870 --> 00:12:32.530
To our future!

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:35.130
You aren't going anywhere.

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:39.340
You are still my pawn, after all.

00:12:52.610 --> 00:12:54.420
Just now, what was that?

00:12:56.780 --> 00:12:59.520
That helmet you currently wear

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:03.260
is installed with a device that delivers 
electric shocks to your brain.

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:07.560
The delivery of electric stimulation 
to a certain portion of the brain

00:13:07.560 --> 00:13:09.230
can increase aggression.

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:11.970
It has been proven in multiple experiments.

00:13:12.280 --> 00:13:16.380
I did not have time to perform 
major brain surgery on you,

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:20.110
but this should be enough to 
make the duel exciting...

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:24.260
Now, make it grander. More aggressive.

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:29.920
Duel so that City's people cannot 
take their eyes off of you.

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:42.270
Go, Yuya!

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:44.740
Now... Jump!

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:51.140
Why won't you go?

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:53.440
Your allies have been captured, right?

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:55.350
Have you gotten scared, Yuya?

00:13:55.780 --> 00:13:58.550
Don't tell me... You...

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:04.960
Every human has bestial instincts 
that remain inside them.

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:08.930
I shall call those out, and bring 
them to the surface.

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:14.510
Now, awaken! The berserker power 
that lies in Yuya Sakaki's heart!

00:14:14.510 --> 00:14:18.370
Release that power. And rampage.

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:32.480
What was that?

00:14:39.240 --> 00:14:41.480
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon is...

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:51.570
What is this?

00:15:01.240 --> 00:15:04.330
Tsukikage told us to lie low for a while,

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:06.920
but how long do we have to keep doing this?

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.920
Don't complain.

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:11.530
Shinji and Kurosaki are also here,

00:15:11.530 --> 00:15:15.020
so I'm sure we'll all eventually 
break out together.

00:15:15.020 --> 00:15:19.460
And Sora said he'd bring Yuya soon. 
I'm sure that'll be the sign.

00:15:20.070 --> 00:15:21.220
Right, Yuzu?

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:24.760
What's going on?

00:15:24.760 --> 00:15:26.910
It keeps blinking...

00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:27.910
I don't know.

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:33.930
Can it be... Is something happening to Yuya?

00:15:51.240 --> 00:15:53.030
What's the matter, Yuya?

00:15:54.440 --> 00:15:58.270
I activate my spell card Catastrophe Draw!

00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:01.640
I destroy five monsters on my side of the field.

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:07.480
And I draw two cards from my deck!

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:13.640
I set the Pendulum Scale

00:16:13.640 --> 00:16:18.420
with Scale 3 Xiangke Magician and 
Scale 8 Xiangsheng Magician!

00:16:27.640 --> 00:16:31.500
Now I can summon monsters between 
Levels 4 and Level 7 simultaneously!

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:34.570
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:16:35.230 --> 00:16:38.380
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:39.840
Pendulum Summon!

00:16:40.190 --> 00:16:44.500
Come out, monsters who serve me!

00:16:46.140 --> 00:16:49.560
Come out, the heroic one with 
beautiful different-colored eyes,

00:16:49.560 --> 00:16:52.300
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:16:54.140 --> 00:16:56.760
Xiangsheng Magician's Pendulum Effect!

00:16:56.760 --> 00:17:03.230
Once per turn, I can change one monster's 
level equal to that of another monster.

00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:06.700
I set your Bora the Spear

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:09.710
to the same level as Odd-Eyes 
Pendulum Dragon, Level 7.

00:17:12.190 --> 00:17:13.440
What in the world?

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:14.650
Battle!

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:17.620
Go, Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon.

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:20.150
Attack...

00:17:20.150 --> 00:17:21.520
...Bora the Spear!

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:27.460
Attack? This wasn't the deal.

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:32.890
Odd-Eyes, burn everything you see 
with your different-colored eyes!

00:17:32.890 --> 00:17:35.340
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:38.640
In that instant...

00:17:38.640 --> 00:17:41.610
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon's effect activates.

00:17:41.610 --> 00:17:44.110
When it battles a monster, Level 5 or higher...

00:17:44.110 --> 00:17:46.310
...it doubles battle damage dealt.

00:17:46.560 --> 00:17:48.050
Reaction Force!

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:53.840
2600 damage, all at once.

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:59.460
I see... This is why Yuya increased 
Crow's monster's level from 4 to 7.

00:17:59.900 --> 00:18:04.300
And things have suddenly gone from a 
leisurely pastime to a hardcore battle.

00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:08.170
That back and forth is part of Yuya's 
style of entertainment, I guess.

00:18:08.680 --> 00:18:12.770
I'm sorry I had the wrong idea, 
and got mad at you before.

00:18:13.300 --> 00:18:15.510
I now end my turn.

00:18:17.560 --> 00:18:18.980
Magnificent!

00:18:18.980 --> 00:18:22.780
You reaction is even better than I had imagined.

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:26.950
Keep it up... Make things even more exciting.

00:18:27.240 --> 00:18:29.690
Weren't you going to save your allies?

00:18:29.950 --> 00:18:32.160
So you were just leading me on.

00:18:32.160 --> 00:18:35.160
Are you working with the Tops, after all?

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:37.130
My turn!

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:41.100
So desperate to win, you'd even lie about 
it. Then, I won't show any mercy!

00:18:41.480 --> 00:18:45.640
I summon Blackwing — Calima the 
Haze from my hand!

00:18:49.150 --> 00:18:51.310
When a Blackwing is on my field,

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:57.080
I can Special Summon Tuner Monster Blackwing 
— Gale the Whirlwind from my hand!

00:18:59.280 --> 00:19:04.740
Level 3 Gale the Whirlwind tunes 
Level 4 Calima the Haze!

00:19:07.190 --> 00:19:09.480
Spread your ebony wings,

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:12.970
and strike the ground with the speed of lightning!

00:19:13.770 --> 00:19:15.100
Synchro Summon!

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:19.840
Rain down, Assault Blackwing — 
Raikiri the Rain Shower!

00:19:20.170 --> 00:19:22.140
I activate Raikiri's effect.

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:27.240
For each Blackwing on my side of the 
field, I destroy one of your cards!

00:19:27.240 --> 00:19:29.750
Now, your side of the field's wide open!

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:38.290
And I attack you directly with Raikiri!

00:19:45.570 --> 00:19:47.230
Crow fights back!

00:19:47.230 --> 00:19:52.440
Yuya loses all monsters on his side of the 
field, and takes 2600 points of damage!

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:54.410
How do you like that?

00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:57.610
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:14.260
Yuya...

00:20:21.210 --> 00:20:22.050
My...

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:23.010
My...

00:20:23.260 --> 00:20:23.850
My...

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:25.140
My...

00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:26.500
...turn!

00:20:30.060 --> 00:20:33.510
For a second, Yuya looked like him.

00:20:34.230 --> 00:20:35.340
Why?

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:41.660
I activate my spell card Amazing 
Pendulum from my hand!

00:20:41.660 --> 00:20:43.450
When no cards are in my Pendulum Zones,

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:47.660
I can add two Pendulum Cards 
from my Extra Deck to my hand.

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:50.750
I set the Pendulum Scale

00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:55.270
with Scale 3 Xiangke Magician and 
Scale 8 Xiangsheng Magician!

00:21:01.270 --> 00:21:05.240
Now I can summon monsters between 
Levels 4 and Level 7 simultaneously!

00:21:05.610 --> 00:21:06.940
Pendulum Summon!

00:21:07.390 --> 00:21:09.650
Be reborn from my Extra Deck,

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:12.700
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:17.320
And from my hand,

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:20.550
Performapal Longphone Bull!

00:21:22.110 --> 00:21:27.150
Longphone Bull's effect lets me add 
a Performapal, of 1000 or fewer

00:21:27.150 --> 00:21:29.740
attack points, Skeeter Skimmer, 
from my deck to my hand.

00:21:29.740 --> 00:21:31.370
Come out, Skeeter Skimmer!

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:36.540
I overlay Level 4 Longphone Bull...

00:21:36.540 --> 00:21:38.780
...and Skeeter Skimmer!

00:21:44.450 --> 00:21:46.650
From the black darkness,

00:21:46.650 --> 00:21:52.190
the fangs of rebellion that fight against 
the powers of stupidity descend!

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:54.160
Xyz Summon!

00:21:54.420 --> 00:21:59.740
Appear, Rank 4 Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:02.830
His dragon, too?

00:22:03.280 --> 00:22:05.040
The one dueling right now...

00:22:05.330 --> 00:22:07.450
Is it really Yuya?

00:23:49.240 --> 00:23:52.180
I'm Sora Shiunin, Yuya's friend.

00:23:52.660 --> 00:23:55.880
I'd like to bring him back to his right mind.

00:23:55.880 --> 00:23:57.040
Help me!

00:23:57.040 --> 00:24:00.110
Yuya's in trouble now, huh?

00:24:00.110 --> 00:24:05.720
I don't know how to restore him to his 
right mind, but I'll do what I can...

00:24:05.720 --> 00:24:07.930
Because I'm Yuya's pal.

00:24:09.560 --> 00:24:13.400
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Lightning Strike!

00:24:13.400 --> 00:24:15.590
The fun is only getting started!
